  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScreenshotStepData
  stepId: Step_18_PrepareTestPlan
  instructionText: "LO3.1 - PREPARE THE TEST PLAN\n\nA technician writes down what
    will be tested and what counts as a pass BEFORE testing, so nothing is skipped
    and the result is not decided after the fact.\n\nYour plan for this job:\n\n 
    1. Shared folder reachable from the client by UNC path\n  2. Shared printer prints
    a test page from the client\n  3. Redirected Documents folder points at the server\n 
    4. Remote Desktop connects from the client\n  5. Connectivity confirmed by ping\n\nEach
    one is performed on CLIENT01, because a service that has only been checked on
    the server has not been tested at all.\n\nTap NEXT to begin testing."
